    39                           ; BattleBot Tank Drive Controller
    40                           ; PIC16F1788
    41                           ; UART Receiver with Two Motor PWM Outputs
    42                           ;
    43                           ; Based on the 2024 Universal Remote Controller packet:
    44                           ; 24 ADDRESS 4A JOY1_UD JOY1_LR JOY2_UD
    45                           ;
    46                           ; Left motor = Joystick 1 Up/Down
    47                           ; Right motor = Joystick 2 Up/Down
    48                           ;
    49                           ; Hardware:
    50                           ; RC2 = CCP1 PWM, Left Motor
    51                           ; RC1 = CCP2 PWM, Right Motor
    52                           ; RA0 = Left Motor Direction
    53                           ; RA1 = Right Motor Direction
    54                           ; RC7 = UART RX
    55                           ; RC6 = UART TX (optional)
    56                           ;
    57                           ; Driver assumes PHASE/ENABLE inputs (DRV8835).
    58                           ; It does NOT directly support RZ7886 FI/BI wiring.
